The *.txt prompt templates in this directory are vendored from graphiti-core 0.30.1
(graphiti_core/prompts: extract_nodes.extract_text, extract_nodes.extract_summaries_batch,
dedupe_nodes.nodes, extract_edges.edge, dedupe_edges.resolve_edge), rendered with
placeholder context values by ../golden/vendor_prompts.py. `{{name}}` marks where
`world_extract::prompts` inserts the per-call context. The text is otherwise unchanged.

